# --- Environment ---
.env

# --- Generated data / indexes ---
# The search indexes ARE committed. The deployed service reads them directly and
# the Render build only installs serving dependencies - it no longer runs
# scripts/ingest.py, which would need the offline PDF/OCR dependencies that
# requirements.txt deliberately excludes. Together these are ~8 MB:
#   data/processed/chunks.jsonl   the chunk store
#   data/processed/evaluation.json the retrieval benchmark report
#   data/indexes/faiss/           FAISS index + metadata
#   data/indexes/bm25/            BM25 index
# Re-run `python scripts/ingest.py` locally and commit the result whenever the
# source PDFs or the chunking configuration change.
#
# Page images are NOT committed: 219 PNGs totalling ~156 MB, and nothing serves
# or reads them (there is no static mount, and the frontend ignores visual_ref).
# The wildcard form is required - git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so `data/processed/` plus a negation would not work.
data/processed/*
!data/processed/chunks.jsonl
!data/processed/evaluation.json

# --- Frontend ---
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

